uploads/
uploads-test/
*.glb.tmp

# Self-signed dev-only HTTPS certificate (needed to test the camera over the
# LAN from a phone — getUserMedia requires a secure context). Regenerate
# locally with `openssl`, never commit private keys.
/certs/

